{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act13side_level_act13side_st04",
  "groupId": "act13side",
  "stageId": "act13side_st04",
  "title": "未知與未來",
  "storyCode": "NL-ST-4",
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act13side/level_act13side_st04.txt",
  "sourceHash": "42675e207e25ca99ec803edfc687da7534cc921dfbb9c2d4326c45a06652bc63",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電視裡的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "特錦賽出現特殊情況——兩位冠軍共赴冠軍牆，這是前所未有的事情！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電視裡的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不僅如此，冠軍耀騎士——拒絕了來自騎士協會的頒獎，獨自離開！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電視裡的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "這毫無疑問是一種褻瀆。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "疼疼疼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "老傢伙，不能打就不要強出頭，交給瑪莉婭和佐菲婭不就好了嗎！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你有臉說我！？啊——疼疼——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "幹嘛老盯著你那把錘子，馬丁，一晚上的熱身運動，讓你懷念起過去了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......有點吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "也不知道臨光家那邊怎麼樣了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "欸？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......叔叔......要暫時離開大騎士領？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你們到底是姓臨光的，別總是待在佐菲婭家裡，不成體統。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......我會離開一段時間，在這期間......瑪嘉烈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......你真的決定留在卡西米爾？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "是的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......你應該知道自己會面對什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你不會被理解。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......當然，我一開始就知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那就這樣吧，我們沒有其他話可說了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "托蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......怎麼突然改性了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......托蘭......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "托蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "突然想要離開大騎士領，哼？為了什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......在你眼裡，我現在是什麼模樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "托蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "能什麼模樣。你自己還不清楚嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "托蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "——但是說真的，你讓我們所有人都失望了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "托蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你可以不是監正會的高層，可以不是改變國民院的那個人，但是，你至少該是我們的英雄，我們的臨光。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "托蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我不知道你離開城市是要去哪，但我得說——除了我以外，他們大都失望了。再讓他們見到你，他們會巴不得殺了你的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那他們打得過我嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "托蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嘖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我放棄了很多東西，托蘭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......只是，我還是經常懷抱著一個不切實際的想法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "他們應該還在某處。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "托蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "他是戰爭英雄的長子，他是我瑪恩納的兄弟，是家族最強大的騎士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "而她......是卡西米爾最美的人，優雅，端莊，如同一顆寶石......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "他們曾是我眼中的天之驕子，他們不該就這麼......了無音訊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "十多年了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我一直在想這件事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "托蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "已經十五年了。當時花了那麼久苦尋無果，現在又想——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......只是......帶薪旅行而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "托蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你一個人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "一趟未必有希望的旅程，一個人還不夠嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "托蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你不是一個會......被耀騎士帶來的情緒感染的人，我就先不問你為什麼突然作出決定了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "托蘭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你知道怎麼找到我......“我們”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......我要找到的，是我自己。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......羅德島嗎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那裡能為你們提供治療，而且，也不會強迫你們做些什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "既然是耀騎士一直以來效力的組織......那麼，也可信吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "他們的理想將會照亮整片大地，哪怕現在，我也這麼相信著。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你還會回到那裡嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......遲早有一天，會的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那那時候能和我比劃比劃嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......艾、艾沃娜！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "幹嘛，想挑戰冠軍不是人之常情嗎！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾納蒂",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那算我一個。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾納蒂",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "傳奇的騎士家族......很令人好奇不是嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......一言為定，到時我一定奉陪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "啊哈哈，這些傢伙鬆了口氣之後就容易興奮起來......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你早就意識到自己不是感染者了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "但你仍舊願意為感染者而戰？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "只是為那些飽受苦難的人們而戰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人麥基",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......董事會很生氣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人麥基",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "看來，我們得少幾個月獎金了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......獎金。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我們把那麼多感染者，騎士，甚至是無胄盟的性命都捲入其中，影響的，居然只是獎金？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人麥基",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......關於這件事......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人麥基",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "跟我來，馬克維茨兄。我們也該討論你的去留了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人麥基",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......你先前關於電話的一席言論，我事後想了想，確實有道理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我們在等誰的電話？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人麥基",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......一位記者的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......呃......記者？我們需要接受記者採訪嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人麥基",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "許多人都這麼稱呼他。只是個稱呼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......等等......記者......難道是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電話那頭的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "麥基嗎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人麥基",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......是。向你介紹一下，現在，在電話那頭的，是玫瑰新聞聯合報業的董事長......“記者”凱恩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電話那頭的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "馬克維茨也在旁邊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "是，很榮幸與您通訊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電話那頭的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "馬克維茨是我花重金從梅什科工業手裡拿下的，他會是我的左膀右臂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電話那頭的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "所以這裡沒有外人，麥基，你可以喊我父親。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人麥基",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......好的，父親。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電話那頭的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嗯，你的母親還好嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人麥基",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "很好，父親。常常念起你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電話那頭的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你呢？你結婚了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人麥基",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......我......暫時還沒有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人麥基",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "您呢？父親？您現在......在哪裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電話那頭的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......哥倫比亞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人麥基",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......您什麼時候回到卡西米爾？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電話那頭的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "呵呵......還沒到時候，麥基。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電話那頭的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那些目光短淺的人看不出，但哥倫比亞才是真正威脅到卡西米爾的敵人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電話那頭的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我們的報紙還沒能覆蓋他們的城市，我們的聲音還傳達不到哥倫比亞人的耳旁。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電話那頭的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "他們發展的速度令人驚恐，我們必須遏制......搶佔他們的市場。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電話那頭的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "國與國博弈是這麼的迷人，麥基。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電話那頭的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "但那些......貴族。呸。固步自封......維多利亞，烏薩斯，這些強大的國家卻又愚昧到令人心疼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電話那頭的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "馬克維茨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "在！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電話那頭的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你願意為商業聯合會奉獻一切嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電話那頭的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你是個能人，只從那些隻言片語的報告中，我就能感覺到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電話那頭的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "難道，你還對那些騎士......心懷悲憫？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電話那頭的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "看來我說中了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電話那頭的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "孩子，請你思考一個問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電話那頭的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "當卡西米爾高速軍艦的數量遠超烏薩斯，當哥倫比亞充斥著卡西米爾的商隊與商品，當邊境要塞的數量比現在翻上一番——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電話那頭的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "戰爭還存在嗎？烏薩斯還是個威脅嗎？卡西米爾還會軟弱嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電話那頭的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "當然，不會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電話那頭的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "騎士們才是卡西米爾的蛀蟲。愚昧的貴族，榮耀......呵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電話那頭的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我聽說了特錦賽發生的事情，監正會難道以為，他們“賺足了面子”？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電話那頭的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "榮耀和面子，要多少就給他們多少吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電話那頭的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "時間和人民站在我們這邊，只消幾場比賽，民眾就會忘記耀騎士帶來的衝擊，而投入下一輪消費與娛樂中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電話那頭的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "對他們而言，“爭論哪一位騎士更強”“爭論騎士周邊的定價是否合理”，比關注我們留下的所有糟粕都要重要。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電話那頭的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "國家站在我們這邊。卡西米爾已經離不開商業聯合會提供的經濟基礎。那些可悲的征戰騎士......有多少已經主動向我們臣服。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電話那頭的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "馬克維茨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電話那頭的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "這一次，你有選擇的權利。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......在我回答之前，我可以先問一個問題嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電話那頭的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "說吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......恰爾內先生......僅僅是因為沒能成功阻止耀騎士闖入比賽，就遭到了流放......以我的標準來看，這不合理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "為什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電話那頭的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "為什麼......恰爾內，啊，你命運的轉捩點，馬克維茨。我也得謝謝他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電話那頭的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不過，如果我告訴你，恰爾內的消失——和耀騎士沒有直接的關係呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電話那頭的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "如果我告訴你，他的流放，僅僅是因為一系列古舊的權力爭鬥，被找了個恰到好處的藉口就流放了呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電話那頭的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "——恰爾內是因為幾年前的一場賄賂東窗事發，被政敵借機流放的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電話那頭的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "和耀騎士一點關係也沒有......和你的命運一點交集也沒有。往往這才是事情的真相，現代的真相就是至高無上的冷漠。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電話那頭的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "馬克維茨，來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電話那頭的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我們將成為大地的喉舌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "text": "......哈？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "怎麼了，不喜歡我們的新店面嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "text": "店面......你們......開了家店？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......你瞎嗎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "text": "不......可是......賣洗手液的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "“源石雲”日用品可是這幾年最受歡迎的品牌——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "——而推出“源石雲”日用品品牌的公司呢，有“三個老闆”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "很快，那三位老闆，就會成為商業聯合會的一員。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "text": "......你們......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......是的，只是為了能加入他們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你知道的內幕越多，你就越會察覺到未來的方向。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "雇傭兵和殺手遲早會過時的，因為他們不需要這麼多，而說到底，殺手不過取人命而已......而他們，能豪取他國。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "這也是時代的選擇，白金。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "對了，來給我們當前台小妹吧，正好缺個服務員。你的模樣也挺標緻的，應該沒問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......嘖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我們會在近期安排一次無胄盟任務，讓我們三個全都人間蒸發，然後找到最好的整容醫師，改頭換面，成為兢兢業業的銷售員。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "text": "所以......你們借感染者造成大停電的時候......做掉了董事會與無胄盟直接對接的每一個人......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......能這麼簡單，也是多虧了他們自己啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "董事會內部可有太多的明爭暗鬥了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "誰能調配無胄盟，誰就具有壓倒性的優勢——哪個董事都不敢明目張膽操縱無胄盟，也不敢讓別人這麼做。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "也正因如此，他們的互相掣肘讓他們對無胄盟失去了控制力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哈哈，講個笑話，卡西米爾人已經不知道自己雇傭的殺手組織頭子姓甚名誰，身在何方了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "text": "......玄鐵大位......是真實存在的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......誰知道呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "也許玄鐵只有一人，也許是兩人。也許玄鐵只是個幌子，也許玄鐵，是指我們兩個青金共同行動的暗號。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "但也有可能，玄鐵今天早上在街上與你擦肩而過，此時正坐在董事會開會，或者在薩米的別墅裡休假。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "沒有人知道。所以他們才值得恐懼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......最後一點，無論如何，你本來是該死的，作為替罪者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我們會盯著你的，你也是個無胄盟，你不會想和我們為敵的，對吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "text": "（得......逃走......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......博士，阿米婭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "啊......臨光小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "特地叫你們來，是為了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "道別的話就別說了。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "我們會再見的，對吧？",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "啊......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "......嗯。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "如果羅德島呼喚我，那麼我一定會前往您的身邊，博士，阿米婭。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "......嗯！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "......我已經在外流浪許多年了，直到現在，我才有時間......回望我的家鄉。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "也許，我該去祖父的墳上祭拜......"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "閃靈",
          "speakerId": "char_147_shining",
          "text": "臨光。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "啊......博士，我們先走一步吧。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "臨光小姐！保重！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "後會有期。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "保重。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "我們很快就會再見的。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "......嗯，保重。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "閃靈",
          "speakerId": "char_147_shining",
          "text": "該說再見了，臨光。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "......閃靈。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "我其實......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "閃靈",
          "speakerId": "char_147_shining",
          "text": "不，我知道你要說什麼。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "閃靈",
          "speakerId": "char_147_shining",
          "text": "倫蒂尼姆，我們親自去。一如你回到這裡。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "閃靈",
          "speakerId": "char_147_shining",
          "text": "那些罪孽......那些過去，我們親自去斬斷。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "夜鶯",
          "speakerId": "char_179_cgbird",
          "text": "......閃靈？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "閃靈",
          "speakerId": "char_147_shining",
          "text": "麗茲......也許真到某個時刻，你會痛恨我。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "閃靈",
          "speakerId": "char_147_shining",
          "text": "但是，相信我，我永遠會在你的身旁。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "夜鶯",
          "speakerId": "char_179_cgbird",
          "text": "我......我怎麼會痛恨你呢？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "閃靈",
          "speakerId": "char_147_shining",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "如果到那時，你需要我的話——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "我向你們起誓——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "——耀騎士瑪嘉烈·臨光，將為你們而戰。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "三天後，大騎士領外，某村莊"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "索娜",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "......就是這裡？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "托蘭",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "是個很不錯的鎮子吧？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "索娜",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "你們總是待在這樣的地方嗎？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "托蘭",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "起初，我待的地方確實就和賊窩差不多，就算眼線遍佈了周遭的各個城市，也頂多在黑市和地下活動。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "托蘭",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "不過之後......我遇到了一些人。他們改變了我的想法。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "托蘭",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "挑重點說吧，再之後，我們和鏽錘打了一仗。知道鏽錘嗎？一群瘋子......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "托蘭",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "很多人都誤以為鏽錘只是一群劫匪，其實不然，那一仗裡，我甚至看到了十幾歲的孩子，拿著鐵管。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "托蘭",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "是不是挺瘋的？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "索娜",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "喔......挺可怕的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "托蘭",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "......這才是他們可怕的地方。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "托蘭",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "鏽錘不是為了對抗文明而誕生的。鏽錘正是因為文明的發展而誕生的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "托蘭",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "別指望他們真的有什麼出路，有什麼目的，把他們當作一個理性的群體來看本來就是錯誤的——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "托蘭",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "他們只是文明的遺孤。當文明發展卻又照顧不到所有人的時候，他們就誕生了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "托蘭",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "無家可歸，無路可去，在源石遍地的貧瘠荒野生存。他們就是天災。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "托蘭",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "托他們的福，我們團結在了一起，然後，也讓我們意識到了一些事情......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "托蘭",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "我們可不想變成那種瘋子。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "索娜",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "......所以呢？我們要做什麼？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "托蘭",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "我想讓你見見幾個人。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "索娜",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "什麼人？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "托蘭",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "幾個感染者。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "索娜",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "感染者？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "托蘭",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "幾個農民，幾個騎士。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "索娜",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "大雜燴喔。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "托蘭",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "幾個工人，幾個賞金獵人。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "托蘭",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "幾個活不下去的村長，幾個筋疲力盡的貴族。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "托蘭",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "幾個大學生，幾個文盲。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "托蘭",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "幾個試圖改變卡西米爾的人。幾個被卡西米爾改變了的人。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "索娜",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "托蘭",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "別這麼吃驚，該吃驚的事情才剛剛開始。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "托蘭",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "索娜，你問過我，挫敗商業聯合會有什麼意義，騎士有什麼意義。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "托蘭",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "我倒是想反問你一個問題，在商人崛起，卡西米爾被商業聯合會死死攥在手裡之前——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "托蘭",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "——是誰在剝削窮人，欺壓百姓？是誰吊死感染者，躲藏在權力築起的高樓之中？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "托蘭",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "是騎士。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "索娜",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "托蘭",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "從來沒有新的邪惡崛起，我們就要扶持上一個反派的道理，何必呢，倒楣的總是自己。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "托蘭",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "不過說實話，儘管商業聯合會幾個字處處透露著醜惡的氣息......但難得還是有可取之處的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "托蘭",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "被城市忽視的人們，應當聯合起來。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "憔悴的少女",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "......托蘭，這就是......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "托蘭",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "大騎士領的感染者騎士，我們已經達成了合作關係。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "托蘭",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "其他人都在嗎？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "憔悴的少女",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "都在，都在裡面......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "托蘭",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "好，你也進來吧，可蘿爾......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "托蘭",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "天已經亮了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
